.At v5 .
This manual was written for OxideBSD.
.Sh CAVEATS
Where the
.Nm
of
.Xr mandoc 1
differs from the language's original description,
.Xr oxdoc 1
follows
.Xr mandoc 1 ,
the formatter the BSDs share:
.Cm sqrt
takes a single box, not an expression;
.Cm from
and
.Cm to
bind as tightly as
.Cm over ;
and a
.Cm from
or
.Cm to
inside braces that are the operand of
.Cm sub ,
.Cm sup ,
.Cm over
or
.Cm sqrt
applies to that operation, leaving the braces.
.Sh BUGS
Positions, sizes and the
.Cm mark
and
.Cm lineup
alignment are ignored.
Equations inside tables are not supported.
